$meta
  title = PrAis Drop Station — the eye and the front door
  description = The build division's drop station (role: video). FOUR DOORS, ONE PAGE. VIDEO DROP: files of ANY size are read straight off the disk — nothing is uploaded, so the editor's ~20 MB attachment cap does not exist in here — and every file is MEASURED before anything is claimed about it (frame-to-frame motion, plus loudness when the file is small enough to hear whole), pulled into stills, a timecoded contact sheet, and clipped at the measured peaks. IMAGE DROP: the pictures they already have, measured and read by the eye. LINK DROP: their site, their socials, their listing, their phone — fetched live and read in code, then cross-checked, which is where the MISSING LINKS are found (a channel their own site never links; a phone number that disagrees between their site and their listing). PROMPT DROP: the sovereign's own words for the job. Then it does its own market research — what was read, and the model's knowledge of the industry, kept strictly apart and labelled — and pulls everything into a BLUEPRINT for the first prototype. It then RUNS THE THREE HANDS RATHER THAN DESCRIBING THEM: the IMAGE hand (text-to-image, in this node), the COPY hand (the register — there is no separate copy agent in this family; the register IS the copy hand), and the VIDEO hand (this node, which cuts the footage and renders the reel, encoded in the browser itself: H.264 + AAC, ~5-7x faster than real time). Every order is re-audited afterwards, so an order only reads PASS when a hand actually produced something — and then THE GATE has the last word: READY TO EXECUTE, NOT YET COMPLETE, or BLOCKED. Only a fault in this node's own output (an invented number, a withheld line, a file that will not play back) is allowed to block; a fault in the client's own site becomes an order the prototype fixes. The copy audit is the register's own law checked in code: no number the offering does not state, and no register example reused. Every file and every word is Soul DNA, captured verbatim (SDNAD) before a model is called, and synced over the Connected Generator Network.
  tags = video, drop, intake, frames, shorts, clips, contact sheet, reel, reel maker, images to video, mp4, webcodecs, market research, link audit, blueprint, audit, story, marketing, vibe, vision, footage, pr-ais, obi, cgn, sdnad, legion
  header
    mode = minimal

generateText = {import:ai-text-plugin}
superFetch = {import:super-fetch-plugin}
kv = {import:kv-plugin}
uploadPlugin = {import:upload-plugin}
generateImage = {import:text-to-image-plugin}
